==========================================================================
  Relacje z baza danych (Database <-> tabele MySQL):
    klienci(id, name, lastname)
    pokoje(id, room_number, type, capacity, price)            <-> Room
    rezerwacje(id, klient_id, room_id, room_number, guests,
               reservation_price, promo_applied,
               visiting_start, visiting_end)                  <-> Reservation
    uslugi(id, rezerwacja_id, service_type, spa_sessions,
           meal_plan, pool_days, pool_sunbed, pool_towel,
           promo_code, promo_discount)                        <-> Service
